lnto a small mixing-glass place half a pony of anisette, half a pony of
orgeat, a pony of absinthe and a whole egg; fill the glass with pure sweet
milk, shake thoroughly with some cracked ice in the shaker, strain into au
egg-shaped punch-glass and serve.', NULL, 'Original uses raw egg; use pasteurized egg for modern preparation.', 'punch', 'shaken', NULL, 18, 'unreviewed');
