Fill large Bar glass 2/3 full Shaved Ice.



3 dashes Gum Syrup



4 dashes Lemon Juice.



1 dash Lime Juice.



1 teaspoonful Abricontine or green Chartreuse.



1/2 jigger Tokay or Sweet Catawba Wine.



1/2 jigger Brandy.



