Fill large Bar glass 1/2 full Shaved Ice.



2 teaspoonfuls Bar Sugar.



1 Egg



1 pony Santa Cruz Rum.



1 jigger Brandy.



Fill up with Milk; shake thoroughly until the mixture creams; strain

into tall thin glass; grate Nutmeg on top and serve.', NULL, 'Original uses raw whole egg; use pasteurized egg for modern preparation.', 'highball', 'shaken', 'grated nutmeg', 14, 'unreviewed');
