Into a Punch bowl pour:



2-1/2 jiggers Lemon Juice.



4 jiggers Peach Brandy.



2 jiggers Cognac Brandy.



2 jiggers Jamaica Rum.



3 pints Ice Water.



Stir well; ladle into Punch glass and serve.', NULL, NULL, 'punch', 'stirred', NULL, 12, 'unreviewed');
