I teaspoonful of Sugar, J wineglass of Water or
Soda, 3 or 4 sprigs of Fre.sh Mint.
    Muddle well until flavour of Mint is well extracted
then take out Mint, and add 2 glasses of old Bourbon
Whisky. Fill tumbler with fine shaved Ice, stir
 well until glass gets frosted, then take some sprigs
 of Mint and insert them in the Ice with stem down
 wards, so that the leaves will be on the surface in
 the shape of a bouquet. Add slices of orange, lemon,
 pineapple, and cherries on top.', NULL, NULL, 'rocks', 'muddled', NULL, NULL, 'unreviewed');
