I dash of Absinthe, J Grenadine, J Vodka,
i Orange Juice, J Gin.
   Shake well, and strain into cocktail glass.
                                                         8i
               BRANDY, AND SLOE GIN.
                         Orange Brandy.
    Pour I gallon of the best French Brandy on the
rinds of i6 Seville oranges in a large pan, the rinds
pared very thin.
    3 pounds of sugar candy crushed fine. 2 Vanilla
 Pods.
   Let it remainfor three days stirring frequently.
Strain through a jelly bag and bottle.
                                       Sloe Gin.
   I gallon unsweetened Gin, i gallon ripe Sloes,
3lbs. Sugar Candy.
   Pick stalks off Sloes, and slightly bruise with a
silver fork, to be then put into a large stone jar.
   Crush Sugar and add.
   Shake once a day for 3 months, and take care jar
has an airtight cork. Put away for 2 years when
strain and bottle.
                        For Cups see page 80.', NULL, NULL, 'cocktail', 'shaken', NULL, NULL, 'unreviewed');
