The juice of two lemons.
The juice of two oranges.
One-half jigger St. Croix Rum.
One jigger Maraschino.
One jigger White Curacoa.
Two jiggers brandy.
i
Two quarts champagne.
One pint Burgundy.
Add quart Apollinaris. Before serving sweeten
according to taste and fruit well,
I I



